# Maintainer-owned quality gates (CONTRIBUTING.md, Engineering
# Constitution, "The linter contract").
# The linter configuration, its integrity anchor, the pinned tool versions
# and the Makefile, release packaging and `hack/` scripts that enforce the
# gates may only change with maintainer review. The handle below is the
# repository owner (personal account); switch it to a maintainer team if the
# project ever moves into an organization.
/.golangci.yml   @ubyte-source
/LINTER.sha256   @ubyte-source
/tools/          @ubyte-source
/Makefile        @ubyte-source
/.goreleaser.yaml @ubyte-source
/.github/workflows/** @ubyte-source
/.github/CODEOWNERS @ubyte-source
/hack/ @ubyte-source
